#: ../../diagrams-guide.md:1 ed894418242044568f6e608f93711256
msgid "Appendix-03: Diagram Quick Reference"
msgstr "附录-03: 图表速查"

#: ../../diagrams-guide.md:5 b7f1210cf40545028b26706bac605de3
msgid ""
"Mermaid is the primary diagramming tool for PKB documentation. This page "
"covers the most common diagram types. For additional examples (class "
"diagrams, ER diagrams, Gantt charts), refer to the Mermaid documentation at "
"<https://mermaid.js.org/intro/>."
msgstr ""
"Mermaid 是 PKB 文档的主要绘图工具。本页覆盖最常见的图表类型。更多示例（类图、ER 图、甘特图）请参阅 Mermaid "
"文档：<https://mermaid.js.org/intro/>。"

#: ../../diagrams-guide.md:7 bc69dba9dc6d49f89a73d79ef93e8318
msgid "Flowcharts"
msgstr "流程图"

#: ../../diagrams-guide.md:22 eb6b76b3a34c4c4285772809a459bc1e
msgid "Sequence Diagrams"
msgstr "时序图"

#: ../../diagrams-guide.md:45 a7c61a1a239e4e61a3150da61d7938ba
msgid "C4 Context Diagram"
msgstr "C4 上下文图"

#: ../../diagrams-guide.md:56 7884bc1b76b641f2abc5295c26f3101f
msgid "State Diagrams"
msgstr "状态图"

#: ../../diagrams-guide.md:71 2601852ba4c94d0ba9ce934e177cb6b3
msgid "Tips"
msgstr "提示"

#: ../../diagrams-guide.md:73 3b68dc681bca4783bf04cf6ef5eab657
msgid ""
"Use `flowchart TD` (top-down) or `flowchart LR` (left-right) for "
"architecture and process diagrams."
msgstr "架构和流程图使用 `flowchart TD`（自上而下）或 `flowchart LR`（从左到右）。"

#: ../../diagrams-guide.md:74 9dbdde2ce6584aa4b3b6820e5defa5b0
msgid "Use `sequenceDiagram` for runtime call chains and API interactions."
msgstr "运行时调用链和 API 交互使用 `sequenceDiagram`。"

#: ../../diagrams-guide.md:75 03327b4a599249919782a5062418e0cb
msgid "Use `stateDiagram-v2` for lifecycle and state machine documentation."
msgstr "生命周期和状态机文档使用 `stateDiagram-v2`。"

#: ../../diagrams-guide.md:76 76fc0632b4474a529bb6ecdb27e59f9a
msgid ""
"Prefer Mermaid over PlantUML -- it renders natively in Sphinx via "
"`sphinxcontrib-mermaid`."
msgstr ""
"优先使用 Mermaid 而非 PlantUML——它可通过 `sphinxcontrib-mermaid` 在 Sphinx 中原生渲染。"

#: ../../diagrams-guide.md:77 9945ae84b70b4bf196301e4cfc0f11c3
msgid "Keep diagrams focused: one concept per diagram, not the entire system."
msgstr "图表保持聚焦：每张图一个概念，而不是整个系统。"
